    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want a quiet space to just \"be.\" i mean, i've spent my whole life being the version they wanted. if i'm not that person, i'm nothing. they'll always look at me and just see the mistake. wouldn't it be easier if they just remembered me the way i was? before i messed everything up?",
