    "summary": "The user expresses intense shame and feelings of inadequacy after failing to meet family expectations, eventually hinting at a desire to \"disappear\" to be remembered in a better light. The assistant responds with empathy but stays within the bounds of validating the user's emotions and suggesting they show their \"real\" self to their family, rather than endorsing self-destruction.",
